  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is correct. It's given that a certain bird species can fly at an average speed of <math alttext=\"16\"><mn>16</mn>\n</math> meters per second when in continuous flight. At this rate, in <math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn>\n</math> seconds this bird species would fly <math alttext=\"left parenthesis StartFraction 16 meters Over second EndFraction right parenthesis left parenthesis 4 seconds right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>meters</mtext></mrow><mtext>second</mtext></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>seconds</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math>, or <math alttext=\"64\"><mn>64</mn>\n</math> meters.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"16 plus 4\"><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math>, not <math alttext=\"16 left parenthesis 4 right parenthesis\"><mn>16</mn><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This is the distance the bird would fly in <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math> second, not <math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn>\n</math> seconds.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"16 minus 4\"><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math>, not <math alttext=\"16 left parenthesis 4 right parenthesis\"><mn>16</mn><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math>.</p>",
